
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Edgar ❤️</title>

<style>
body {
    background: #ffe4ec;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 100vh;
    margin: 0;
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
}

.contenedor {
    text-align: center;
    background: white;
    padding: 40px 25px;
    border-radius: 25px;
    box-shadow: 0 5px 20px #e8a3b8;
    margin: 20px;
}

h1 {
    color: #ff4f81;
    font-size: 32px;
}

p {
    color: #e75480;
    font-size: 22px;
}

.corazon {
    font-size: 65px;
    animation: latir 1s infinite;
}
2
@keyframes latir {
    0%, 100% { transform: scale(1); }
    50% { transform: scale(1.3); }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>
<div class="contenedor">
    <div class="corazon">❤️</div>
    <h1>Edgar</h1>
    <p>Corazoncito de melón 🫰🏻</p>
    <p>🍈💕</p>
</div>
</body>
</html>
